  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "drowzeys' tuned single-Spark serve of unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 (MTP head baked in) on vLLM 0.27 (eugr spark-vllm-b12x nightly-20260813, mirrored by drowzeys), native FlashInfer CUTLASS NVFP4 GEMM, FP8 KV cache and MTP speculative decoding at depth 3. Defaults are upstream's Profile A (throughput): 262144 context, GPU memory 0.90, qwen3_xml tool parser, flashinfer autotune; the sequence limit is left to vLLM. Upstream reports (not measured here) 31.7 tok/s single stream (2.85x the 11.1 baseline), 313 tok/s aggregate at 64-way and a 2.31M-token KV pool. Upstream's Profile B (1M context, YaRN 4x via --rope-scaling) is not included: its launcher passes a --rope-scaling flag that drowzeys' own Qwen3.8 repo says eugr 0.27 dropped. Licence: checkpoint Apache-2.0; drowzeys repository declares none. Not gated.",
